{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"生成元 (范畴论)"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"生成元(范畴论)"},0],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 的对象 $X$ 称为<strong>生成元</strong>是指 $\\operatorname{Hom}(X,-)\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathsf{Set}$ 忠实; 换言之, 仅考虑 $X$ 出发的"},{"Local":{"url":"广义元素","text":"广义元素"}},{"Plain":"的去向, 就能区分处 $\\mathcal C$ 中的态射.</p>\n<p>若范畴 $\\mathcal C$ 具有余积, 则对象 $X$ 为生成元等价于对任意对象 $Y$,\n$$\r\n\\bigsqcup_{X\\to Y}X \\to Y\r\n$$\n为"},{"Local":{"url":"满射(范畴论)","text":"满射"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}